*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.zip
*.log
*.pkl
.DS_Store
*.xlsx
# Source papers are cited, never redistributed: a `replicate`-mode case is
# built from a published article whose copyright the publisher holds, and an
# author's own copy is usually a courtesy copy carrying exactly that
# restriction. Cite it in the case README (authors, venue, DOI); do not commit
# it. Committed figures are the domain's own — see spec §14.3.
*.pdf
tensorboard_*/
results/
.venv/
*.egg-info/
# Build artifacts: the wheel and sdist are published to PyPI from a
# tag, never tracked — a committed one would race the tag it claims.
*.whl
*.tar.gz
dist/
scratch/
